  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sociedad Cooperativa 10 de octubre (Cooperativa 10 de octubre), $43,675 for one year Cooperativa 10 de octubre will engage its 300 members, all residents of three rural communities of Tlaxcala, in assessing needs and priorities, in drafting proposals that benefit the environment and in developing the organization. (ME-511)</narrative>
